  "sources": {
    "4 Layer 35µm ENIG rules (0.8 and 1.6 mm): min tracewidth 125 µm, min copper spacing 125 µm, min via drill 0.25 mm, max via drill 0.45 mm, min via annular ring 100 µm, min PTH drill 0.5 mm, PTH annular ring 300 µm, min drill spacing 300 µm, copper to edge 300 µm, silkscreen width 150 µm / text height 800 µm, soldermask dam 100 µm, suggested soldermask expansion 50 µm, ENIG Ni 4-7 µm / Au 0.05-0.1 µm": "https://community.aisler.net/t/4-layer-35-m-enig-design-rules/3733",
